お願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://lit.link/fujishiroyuduru", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 2819743, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a90cdea85c7c85d1563a8fb5bf95f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a90cdea85c7c85d1563a8fb5bf95f8, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8898d856858e4c95f23692a5d7379d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4989cfa5f4a9d6a25a6c4714dc122522 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2eff3421d6a79029028219e3e5bb6b4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2eff3421d6a79029028219e3e5bb6b4, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c6cd18c6354bc820f402cec0b27dd020 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52f549c3d48d2e56036d1d66a321685d 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. My name is Yuzuru Fujishiro and I am a private VTuber.\n\nI found you through a tag on Twitter, and I really like your illustrations of Nurarihyon's grandchildren and the way you paint your illustrations.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration including the background if you don't mind.\n\nI am a crane demon.\nThe humanoid is a girl of about 15 years old.\nShe is a crane demon and a land god of the wisteria forest.\nI like human children. I like human children so much that I hide them from the gods if I like them.\nShe has wisteria-colored eyes and twilight-colored odd eyes.\nShe has long gray (silver) hair that reaches her waist and hips.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her in a horizontal 9:16 format.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw a human figure in the front and a demon figure in the back.\n\nWe would like to use the illustrations as icons, advertisements, thumbnails, etc. on Twitter, YouTube, etc.\nWe would appreciate it if you could enclose transparent backgrounds of the human figure and the demon figure, respectively.\n\nPlease feel free to draw the poses and backgrounds as you like.\nWe will provide the URL for the background and details, so please use it to get an idea of what you are looking for.\n\nWe are willing to add a commission fee to the drawing cost, as we expect the drawing cost to be high. We would really like you to draw it for us.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate it very much.\n\nYuzuru Fujishiro\n\nhttps://lit.link/fujishiroyuduru", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 263850, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "えんがわ🍣skeb open!", "screen_name": "engawa110", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F8f728b08